WEBVTT

01:30.840 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.060 --> 01:38.000
[Episode 13]

01:47.680 --> 01:48.479
You're awake.

01:50.870 --> 01:51.430
If it weren't for

01:51.430 --> 01:52.789
my quick reflexes,

01:53.150 --> 01:55.210
you would've been trampled to death.

01:55.759 --> 01:58.020
In the end, I just got beaten for nothing.

01:59.560 --> 02:00.150
Pingwen.

02:00.710 --> 02:01.840
Where are we going?

02:02.120 --> 02:03.120
Are you stupid?

02:03.310 --> 02:04.390
We're going home.

02:04.680 --> 02:05.510
We're beaten up this badly.

02:05.510 --> 02:06.770
Where else could we go?

02:07.400 --> 02:09.400
It wasn't easy escaping that place.

02:09.610 --> 02:10.870
Stop, I'm getting off.

02:11.340 --> 02:12.680
I need to return to the camp.

02:12.680 --> 02:14.190
What are you going back to the camp for?

02:14.190 --> 02:15.360
With all this chaos,

02:15.400 --> 02:16.070
people get trampled

02:16.070 --> 02:17.590
like they're nothing but ants.

02:17.590 --> 02:18.310
Several people

02:18.310 --> 02:19.960
were trampled to death back there,

02:19.960 --> 02:21.890
and no one even knows who they were.

02:25.030 --> 02:26.890
I'd be a fool to trust you again...

02:28.900 --> 02:29.500
Pingyuan.

02:29.560 --> 02:30.160
Pingyuan!

02:31.150 --> 02:33.010
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

02:33.750 --> 02:34.900
Yimei is still in the military camp.

02:34.900 --> 02:36.430
Those women are still in the camp.

02:36.430 --> 02:37.120
I need to bring them back.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.150
They can't come back, Pingyuan.

02:38.150 --> 02:39.030
They can't return.

02:39.030 --> 02:39.840
That's a military camp.

02:39.840 --> 02:40.630
Who do you think you are?

02:40.630 --> 02:41.750
Then what should we do?

02:41.750 --> 02:43.010
Watch them die?

02:43.579 --> 02:45.690
Many people have already died!

02:46.680 --> 02:48.030
Just now, you and I

02:48.120 --> 02:49.160
almost died!

02:49.190 --> 02:49.840
If we die,

02:49.840 --> 02:51.100
no one would even know.

02:51.190 --> 02:52.590
No one should die in vain.

02:53.120 --> 02:53.790
No one.

02:54.680 --> 02:55.870
If I can't even protect

02:55.870 --> 02:57.520
the women and children of the village,

02:57.520 --> 02:59.120
can I still call myself a man?

02:59.630 --> 03:00.370
Out of my way!

03:01.280 --> 03:02.130
Don't stop me.

03:07.560 --> 03:09.960
Why are you trying to be a hero,
Gu Pingyuan?

03:10.430 --> 03:11.950
You just talk big.

03:12.630 --> 03:14.160
I may be a coward,

03:14.400 --> 03:16.460
but at least I take care of our mother!

03:17.560 --> 03:18.110
You!

03:18.190 --> 03:19.120
You were gone for so many years,

03:19.120 --> 03:21.250
Mother's eyes went blind from crying!

03:21.430 --> 03:22.590
When the soldiers came,

03:22.590 --> 03:23.590
she hid in the stove

03:23.590 --> 03:25.590
and survived on sweet potato scraps
for 3 days and 3 nights.

03:25.590 --> 03:26.630
I hid on the beam

03:26.660 --> 03:27.870
and nearly starved to death.

03:27.870 --> 03:29.520
Where were you when that happened?

03:29.520 --> 03:30.079
Why didn't you

03:30.079 --> 03:31.520
say that back then?

03:33.470 --> 03:35.190
Now you're finally back,

03:35.360 --> 03:37.300
and you're already leaving!

03:38.000 --> 03:38.840
What do you take us

03:38.840 --> 03:39.800
for?

04:01.080 --> 04:02.620
If our commanding general dies today,

04:02.620 --> 04:04.550
none of you will make it back alive!

04:04.750 --> 04:05.150
Hurry!

04:06.360 --> 04:08.050
How is the commanding general?

04:08.050 --> 04:09.240
He's still bleeding.

04:09.240 --> 04:10.520
Save the general, quickly!

04:10.520 --> 04:11.000
Hurry up!

04:11.000 --> 04:11.430
You,

04:11.560 --> 04:13.380
go get a cloth to cover his face.

04:13.900 --> 04:15.520
He's not dead. Why cover his face?

04:15.520 --> 04:16.370
I'm scared.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.100
Here, General.

04:28.160 --> 04:28.720
Hurry up!

04:29.120 --> 04:30.000
Alright.

04:33.250 --> 04:33.970
Go get

04:34.480 --> 04:36.470
a sharp knife, alcohol, wound medicine,

04:36.470 --> 04:37.270
and a brazier.

04:37.570 --> 04:38.070
Okay.

04:38.270 --> 04:39.270
Quick!

04:39.310 --> 04:39.920
The brazier!

04:39.920 --> 04:40.850
Alcohol! Hurry!

04:52.430 --> 04:53.130
Li Cheng!

04:54.600 --> 04:56.000
Tell Li Cheng to come out!

04:57.310 --> 04:58.270
I need to see him!

05:00.390 --> 05:01.240
Li Cheng!

05:18.520 --> 05:19.290
General.

05:27.270 --> 05:28.450
I need to dig out the iron sand

05:28.450 --> 05:29.180
in his wound.

05:29.600 --> 05:30.510
You need to hold him down.

05:30.510 --> 05:31.310
Alright.

05:39.230 --> 05:40.700
I told you to hold him down!
What were you doing?

05:40.700 --> 05:41.680
The iron sand will sink deeper

05:41.680 --> 05:42.490
into his wound like this.

05:42.490 --> 05:44.090
If I can't get it out, can you?

05:44.190 --> 05:44.680
Yes.

05:44.830 --> 05:45.240
Come.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.159
Come quickly.

06:30.630 --> 06:31.690
I'll pull out the arrow for you.

06:31.690 --> 06:32.150
No.

06:33.120 --> 06:34.180
He'll die if you do.

06:35.350 --> 06:37.150
We must remove the arrow's body,

06:37.159 --> 06:38.800
slowly push the arrowhead out,

06:38.800 --> 06:41.060
and sew the wound up
with lamb intestine.

07:00.190 --> 07:00.950
Water.

07:03.800 --> 07:04.830
Water...

07:35.630 --> 07:37.090
You've lost a lot of blood.

07:37.159 --> 07:38.650
You can't drink too much water.

07:38.650 --> 07:39.980
Just moisten your lips.

08:24.600 --> 08:25.930
Look, he's much better.

08:26.680 --> 08:28.430
He really does look much better.

08:28.430 --> 08:29.040
Yes.

08:30.950 --> 08:32.409
You're really something.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.000
I think he'll be fine now.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.440
General, moving on,

08:46.440 --> 08:47.440
you need to eat well

08:47.440 --> 08:48.900
to build up your strength.

08:48.960 --> 08:49.560
I think...

08:50.480 --> 08:52.210
You'll recover in a month or so.

09:05.660 --> 09:06.210
This...

09:06.240 --> 09:07.300
What are you doing?

09:07.440 --> 09:08.360
The general values this

09:08.360 --> 09:09.200
like his own eyes.

09:09.200 --> 09:10.870
You're just writing on it like that?

09:10.870 --> 09:11.630
If he's dead,

09:12.000 --> 09:13.120
what good are his eyes?

09:13.120 --> 09:13.580
Well...

09:27.980 --> 09:32.370
[Angelica sinensis, Dipsacus asper 1 tael,
Cynanchum paniculatum
3 taels, Deer antler 0.5 tael]

09:32.790 --> 09:34.080
Get medicine according to
this prescription.

09:34.080 --> 09:35.890
Take it once a day,
and his fever will subside in 3 days.

09:35.890 --> 09:37.030
His heart and lungs will then be safe.

09:37.030 --> 09:37.600
Alright.

09:39.240 --> 09:39.570
[Angelica sinensis, Dipsacus asper 1 tael,
Cynanchum paniculatum
3 taels, Deer antler 0.5 tael]

09:41.630 --> 09:42.160
Let's go.

09:42.440 --> 09:43.080
Come on.

09:43.120 --> 09:43.980
Those women...

09:46.390 --> 09:48.190
You didn't kill anyone, did you?

09:48.320 --> 09:49.580
What do you take us for?

09:49.960 --> 09:51.420
We don't raise our weapons

09:51.510 --> 09:53.110
against defenseless women.

09:53.150 --> 09:53.880
Don't worry.

09:53.910 --> 09:55.370
We didn't hurt any of them.

10:02.940 --> 10:04.000
What are you doing?

10:05.480 --> 10:06.570
I'm going back too.

10:06.760 --> 10:07.720
You can't leave.

10:08.550 --> 10:10.210
Only when the arrow is removed

10:10.310 --> 10:11.510
and he's up and about,

10:11.560 --> 10:13.220
will your life be fully saved.

10:13.580 --> 10:14.780
Watch him carefully.

10:52.390 --> 10:54.670
Who taught you your medical skills?

10:57.270 --> 10:58.670
I learned from my father.

10:59.630 --> 11:00.860
When I recover,

11:00.960 --> 11:02.670
I will reward you generously.

11:06.320 --> 11:07.780
Tell me about your father.

11:08.440 --> 11:09.840
What kind of person is he?

11:13.430 --> 11:14.750
My father is a scholar

11:15.490 --> 11:17.550
who never passed the imperial exams.

11:17.790 --> 11:18.500
He said,

11:19.510 --> 11:20.970
"If not a famous minister,

11:21.360 --> 11:22.760
then a renowned doctor."

11:23.600 --> 11:25.150
Later, he stopped taking exams

11:25.150 --> 11:26.910
and became a teacher in the village.

11:26.910 --> 11:27.910
He opened a school

11:28.320 --> 11:29.440
to teach the kids

11:30.120 --> 11:31.510
and studied medicine himself.

11:31.510 --> 11:33.440
Tell your father to stop teaching.

11:33.750 --> 11:35.810
All that Confucius and Mencius stuff

11:36.240 --> 11:37.360
is useless anyway.

11:38.750 --> 11:39.900
Come to my army

11:40.080 --> 11:41.390
and be a doctor.

11:44.750 --> 11:46.350
Have you ever been educated?

11:49.480 --> 11:51.600
People who are educated
and understand principles

11:51.600 --> 11:52.730
would never do this.

11:53.150 --> 11:54.440
Because of your war,

11:54.720 --> 11:56.270
we couldn't sell our tea

11:56.440 --> 11:57.640
or bring in supplies.

11:58.510 --> 12:00.370
Men live in fear of being drafted.

12:00.790 --> 12:02.720
When the tea forest was burned down,

12:02.720 --> 12:04.920
the whole village cried for a whole day.

12:05.840 --> 12:07.120
But no one came to help.

12:22.910 --> 12:24.040
Drink the medicine.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.210
Just leave it there.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.200
If you don't take the medicine,

12:27.200 --> 12:28.770
they won't let us leave.

12:42.000 --> 12:42.550
It's hot.

13:00.030 --> 13:00.790
I'm done.

13:04.960 --> 13:06.200
What's your name?

13:07.390 --> 13:08.600
My name is Bai Yimei.

13:13.150 --> 13:15.280
Fitting name for your heartlessness.

15:24.840 --> 15:25.700
What happened?

15:25.970 --> 15:27.010
There was a big explosion!

15:27.010 --> 15:28.000
Is everyone all right?

15:28.000 --> 15:28.480
We're fine.

15:28.480 --> 15:29.340
What happened?

15:29.670 --> 15:30.240
Guards!

15:32.390 --> 15:32.920
Yes, sir.

15:33.130 --> 15:34.000
It's not an enemy attack!

15:34.000 --> 15:34.440
Yimei.

15:34.760 --> 15:36.160
Come, help me untie this.

15:36.200 --> 15:36.730
General!

15:36.750 --> 15:38.880
The explosives in the hay barn blew up.

15:42.010 --> 15:42.600
No!

15:43.000 --> 15:43.510
No!

15:51.240 --> 15:52.500
Put your weapons away.

15:52.840 --> 15:53.390
General.

15:54.270 --> 15:55.510
Get up and speak.

16:01.350 --> 16:02.610
So you're still alive.

16:03.600 --> 16:05.530
We still have business to discuss.

16:07.200 --> 16:08.790
You set off those explosives?

16:08.790 --> 16:10.320
Clever move.

16:12.950 --> 16:15.210
What's your relationship with Miss Bai?

16:19.200 --> 16:20.140
We are engaged.

16:24.510 --> 16:26.200
You trespassed into my military camp.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.550
That's a capital offense.

16:27.550 --> 16:28.360
But considering

16:28.360 --> 16:29.960
what Miss Bai has done for me,

16:30.630 --> 16:31.780
I'll let you go.

16:32.390 --> 16:32.870
Go.

16:34.480 --> 16:35.960
If I wanted to leave,
I would have left already.

16:35.960 --> 16:36.790
I came here to take

16:36.790 --> 16:38.030
all those prisoners with me.

16:38.030 --> 16:39.270
General, let's just kill him.

16:39.270 --> 16:40.670
Don't waste words on him.

16:41.000 --> 16:41.720
Fine.

16:42.550 --> 16:44.960
Let's continue our business discussion.

16:45.950 --> 16:47.320
Besides those hemp ropes,

16:47.320 --> 16:48.870
I can also supply you with tung oil.

16:48.870 --> 16:49.690
Tung oil?

16:49.960 --> 16:50.550
How much?

16:50.780 --> 16:52.550
If I gather all the tung oil in Huizhou,

16:52.550 --> 16:54.550
there would be at least
several thousand barrels.

16:54.550 --> 16:56.240
I'll sell you hemp ropes and tung oil.

16:56.240 --> 16:58.370
In exchange, release all those women.

16:58.790 --> 17:00.620
Are you really not a spy?

17:01.440 --> 17:02.150
Whether I'm a spy or not

17:02.150 --> 17:03.080
doesn't matter anymore.

17:03.080 --> 17:04.030
As long as the hemp ropes
and tung oil are real,

17:04.030 --> 17:05.359
isn't that good enough?

17:07.510 --> 17:08.710
You make a good point.

17:11.000 --> 17:11.680
All right.

17:12.349 --> 17:13.400
As for the payment,

17:13.400 --> 17:15.460
I won't short you a single candareen.

17:15.480 --> 17:17.410
I'll release all those women, too.

17:17.829 --> 17:18.589
However...

17:19.880 --> 17:21.210
If you and I do business,

17:21.240 --> 17:22.829
what will you do if the government

17:22.829 --> 17:25.089
accuses you of colluding with the enemy?

17:25.160 --> 17:26.220
It doesn't matter.

17:28.310 --> 17:30.040
I'd be the only one guilty of it.

17:30.550 --> 17:31.880
It's a small price to pay

17:32.240 --> 17:33.700
for saving so many people.

17:34.550 --> 17:37.000
Risking your life for a business deal?

17:37.310 --> 17:38.720
Are you a fool?

17:39.240 --> 17:41.440
Business always requires investment.

17:41.440 --> 17:43.270
Sometimes a life is also part of the cost.

17:43.270 --> 17:44.470
I can keep my promise.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.380
I hope you will, too, General.

17:47.550 --> 17:49.100
They're not related to you.

17:49.400 --> 17:50.200
Is it worth it?

17:50.200 --> 17:52.350
Whether it's worth it
isn't for you to decide.

17:52.350 --> 17:53.590
It's what I think that matters.

17:53.590 --> 17:54.390
Brother Gu...

17:58.830 --> 17:59.510
Fine.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.250
Let this man go.

18:02.590 --> 18:04.080
Let those women go too.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.030
Except Miss Bai.

18:06.720 --> 18:07.250
Yes, sir.

18:08.480 --> 18:08.960
Li Cheng?

18:08.960 --> 18:09.680
Take him away.

18:09.680 --> 18:10.300
Li Cheng!

18:10.400 --> 18:11.900
I mean all women,

18:12.270 --> 18:13.110
including Bai Yimei!

18:13.110 --> 18:13.640
Gu!

18:13.790 --> 18:14.520
Li Cheng!

18:14.720 --> 18:16.000
You broke your promise.

18:16.000 --> 18:16.680
Li Cheng!

18:18.830 --> 18:20.160
When I recover,

18:21.480 --> 18:22.880
I'll let you go.

18:42.400 --> 18:42.920
Father.

18:43.400 --> 18:43.920
Father.

18:47.110 --> 18:49.200
Mother, I'm here.

19:01.310 --> 19:02.110
My child.

19:07.920 --> 19:09.950
I finally see you all again.

19:33.750 --> 19:34.480
Sir.

19:36.270 --> 19:37.080
Yimei is

19:39.390 --> 19:41.590
treating someone at the military camp.

19:42.400 --> 19:43.030
It will be a few days

19:43.030 --> 19:44.630
before we can bring her back.

19:47.620 --> 19:49.620
My daughter-in-law.

19:51.830 --> 19:53.540
You scared me to death.

19:55.950 --> 19:57.510
I'm fine.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.930
As long as I'm still breathing,

20:01.480 --> 20:03.210
I will protect her with my life.

20:03.550 --> 20:04.880
Please don't be too sad.

20:09.440 --> 20:11.240
Better to be a dog in peaceful times

20:11.240 --> 20:13.280
than a human in chaotic times.

20:16.770 --> 20:18.980
I wish I were dead!

20:21.480 --> 20:23.210
I wish...

20:23.510 --> 20:24.510
I were dead.

20:59.010 --> 21:00.080
Pingyuan, please don't be angry

21:00.080 --> 21:00.670
anymore, okay?

21:00.670 --> 21:01.640
Look, after that,

21:01.640 --> 21:02.270
I gathered my courage

21:02.270 --> 21:03.110
and went back
to the military camp to find you.

21:03.110 --> 21:04.350
Look how badly they beat me.

21:04.350 --> 21:07.490
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

21:04.720 --> 21:05.770
Pingyuan, please don't tell Mother

21:05.770 --> 21:06.830
that we had a fight.

21:06.940 --> 21:07.750
Why don't you hit me instead?

21:07.750 --> 21:08.550
I won't fight back.

21:08.550 --> 21:10.210
Just leave me alone, will you?

21:10.310 --> 21:12.310
What's with all that noise outside?

21:12.960 --> 21:14.430
Pingyuan, are you back?

21:14.640 --> 21:16.370
Don't tell Mother where I went.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.510
Mom, I'm back.

21:27.840 --> 21:29.040
Mom, I'm back.

21:31.000 --> 21:31.750
Mom.

21:33.420 --> 21:35.680
Son, you're finally back.

21:35.880 --> 21:37.640
You really had me worried sick.

21:39.430 --> 21:40.590
Your brother said you've been

21:40.590 --> 21:42.720
in the city doing business these days.

21:42.830 --> 21:43.880
I told him you just got back home

21:43.880 --> 21:45.310
and haven't even settled in yet.

21:45.310 --> 21:47.190
What business could you possibly have?

21:47.190 --> 21:48.760
A friend of mine in town

21:49.110 --> 21:50.590
asked me to get him some hemp rope,

21:50.590 --> 21:51.720
tung oil, and stuff.

21:51.920 --> 21:53.720
I thought I could earn some money

21:53.750 --> 21:54.510
and use it to renovate

21:54.510 --> 21:55.270
our house.

21:56.070 --> 21:57.540
With all this chaos,

21:57.750 --> 21:59.540
it's hard to get a good friend.

21:59.640 --> 22:00.470
Who is he?

22:00.830 --> 22:02.030
You should invite him

22:02.030 --> 22:03.230
to visit us sometime.

22:06.510 --> 22:07.310
He's called

22:08.670 --> 22:09.580
Li Cheng.

22:09.750 --> 22:10.820
He's, uh,

22:11.000 --> 22:11.800
from Guangxi.

22:12.180 --> 22:13.840
He just arrived in Anhui, too.

22:14.200 --> 22:15.400
He's very hospitable,

22:15.400 --> 22:16.140
so

22:16.350 --> 22:18.010
he kept me there for a few days.

22:18.880 --> 22:20.480
You're trying to fool me.

22:22.310 --> 22:25.040
You shouldn't charge money
for helping a friend.

22:25.110 --> 22:27.040
We must keep our hearts righteous.

22:28.200 --> 22:29.330
I'm not lying to you.

22:29.750 --> 22:31.480
We're doing business together.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.880
I'm not costing him much.

22:33.160 --> 22:35.260
My son is going to have a better life.

22:36.400 --> 22:37.200
Our family

22:37.240 --> 22:38.850
is going to prosper.

22:42.440 --> 22:42.960
Mom.

22:43.550 --> 22:45.210
Let me tell you more good news.

22:45.350 --> 22:46.480
All the women in the village

22:46.480 --> 22:47.610
have been released.

22:48.200 --> 22:49.190
But Yimei

22:49.350 --> 22:51.160
needs to stay in town for a few more days.

22:51.160 --> 22:52.350
She needs to treat someone.

22:52.350 --> 22:53.240
When she returns,

22:53.240 --> 22:55.030
I'll have her come
pay her respects to you.

22:55.030 --> 22:55.790
Then you should quickly

22:55.790 --> 22:57.240
go tell Mr. Bai.

22:57.540 --> 22:58.240
Mother.

22:58.270 --> 23:00.310
We've already told Mr. Bai.

23:02.480 --> 23:03.680
In the past few years,

23:04.200 --> 23:05.330
Yimei

23:05.480 --> 23:07.300
has visited us the most.

23:07.510 --> 23:09.390
See the gown I'm wearing

23:09.720 --> 23:11.310
and Pingwen's shoes?

23:11.350 --> 23:12.580
She made them all.

23:14.590 --> 23:16.040
You must treat her well,

23:16.510 --> 23:17.770
or I won't stand for it.

23:18.550 --> 23:19.550
What are you saying?

23:19.550 --> 23:20.640
I wouldn't dare mistreat her.

23:20.640 --> 23:21.970
Please have some water.

23:23.200 --> 23:23.800
Oh, Mom.

23:24.070 --> 23:24.810
This afternoon, Pingyuan and I

23:24.810 --> 23:25.950
need to go out again.

23:26.070 --> 23:27.270
We ordered 200 tea seedlings

23:27.270 --> 23:28.230
that we need to bring back.

23:28.230 --> 23:28.680
Oh, right.

23:28.680 --> 23:29.880
Time waits for no one.

23:29.880 --> 23:31.790
Once we bring them back,
we need to plant them right away.

23:31.790 --> 23:33.110
We're trying to harvest another batch

23:33.110 --> 23:34.840
before the Qingming Festival.

23:35.960 --> 23:37.460
I'm really getting old.

23:38.790 --> 23:40.920
I've always thought of you two as kids.

23:42.960 --> 23:44.000
But in the blink of an eye,

23:44.000 --> 23:45.860
you've both grown into young men.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.820
Just keep thinking of us that way.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.110
No matter when,

23:50.680 --> 23:51.750
Pingwen and I will always be

23:51.750 --> 23:52.750
kids in your eyes.

24:21.030 --> 24:22.690
These are blades and needles.

24:22.960 --> 24:25.430
Wipe them clean with alcohol

24:25.590 --> 24:27.110
and sterilize them with fire before use.

24:27.110 --> 24:28.970
I haven't used them in a long time.

24:30.820 --> 24:31.640
These hands of mine

24:31.640 --> 24:32.790
sometimes shake terribly.

24:32.790 --> 24:34.320
I won't need these anymore.

24:34.690 --> 24:36.330
[Wound Medicine]

24:35.000 --> 24:36.400
These porcelain bottles contain medicine.

24:36.400 --> 24:37.070
Yimei knows

24:37.110 --> 24:38.370
what they're used for.

24:40.750 --> 24:42.270
If anything is missing, just tell me,

24:42.270 --> 24:43.040
I'll find it.

24:44.070 --> 24:45.510
Let your disciples handle the work.

24:45.510 --> 24:47.170
You have plenty of disciples.

24:47.310 --> 24:48.040
Don't worry.

24:48.750 --> 24:49.750
You...

24:50.960 --> 24:52.960
Always finding new ways to humor me.

24:53.010 --> 24:53.940
[Wound Medicine]

24:53.830 --> 24:55.490
Though I have good disciples,

24:56.110 --> 24:57.840
they're all busy with farming.

25:00.960 --> 25:02.790
I am a useless teacher.

25:06.550 --> 25:07.610
Tao Yuanming said,

25:08.070 --> 25:09.590
"Trapped by the demands
of the mundane world,

25:09.590 --> 25:11.550
30 years have gone past in an instant."

25:11.550 --> 25:12.960
Who says you must be an official

25:12.960 --> 25:14.440
to achieve something in life?

25:14.440 --> 25:16.580
Some old sayings need to be changed.

25:17.590 --> 25:19.120
After bringing Yimei back,

25:19.240 --> 25:20.160
I plan to properly

25:20.160 --> 25:21.960
reorganize the tea plantation.

25:22.200 --> 25:23.350
Earlier this afternoon, Pingwen and I

25:23.350 --> 25:25.120
bought some tea seedlings back.

25:25.120 --> 25:27.320
No matter who's fighting in this world,

25:27.720 --> 25:29.790
people will always
need to drink tea, right?

25:29.790 --> 25:30.790
Just wait and see.

25:34.500 --> 25:36.360
I have an old friend who roasts tea

25:36.480 --> 25:38.680
in Zhonghe Village on the mountain
across from here.

25:38.680 --> 25:39.750
His surname is Liao.

25:39.750 --> 25:41.310
You can invite him over.

25:41.590 --> 25:43.480
Your mother and Pingwen once met him

25:43.480 --> 25:45.410
when he came to roast tea years ago.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.280
That's great.

25:46.350 --> 25:47.640
I've been wanting to learn tea roasting.

25:47.640 --> 25:49.300
I could take him as my teacher.

25:50.350 --> 25:51.900
Liao is quite stubborn.

25:52.110 --> 25:53.550
If I don't keep an eye on things,

25:53.550 --> 25:55.160
I'm afraid he won't teach you at all.

25:55.160 --> 25:57.510
Speaking of which,
with these years of war,

25:57.510 --> 25:59.830
Liao hasn't come to roast tea
in a long while.

25:59.830 --> 26:00.400
Oh well.

26:01.310 --> 26:02.770
If he refuses to teach you,

26:03.640 --> 26:04.960
I'll take this walking stick

26:04.960 --> 26:07.220
and give him a good whack on his backside.

26:18.510 --> 26:19.370
Can you bear it?

26:20.400 --> 26:21.400
Does it hurt a lot?

26:21.510 --> 26:23.710
It should have been pulled out long ago.

26:27.880 --> 26:29.340
We need medicine for this.

26:29.350 --> 26:31.790
First, we need to remove
the flesh around it.

26:31.790 --> 26:33.390
If we pull it out carelessly,

26:33.790 --> 26:34.920
blood will gush out,

26:35.350 --> 26:36.950
and you'll be beyond saving.

26:37.270 --> 26:38.720
Come on, pull it out.

26:47.880 --> 26:49.290
I'm going to pull it out now.

26:49.290 --> 26:51.090
Do you want something to bite on?

26:51.310 --> 26:52.240
If I'm afraid of pain,

26:52.240 --> 26:53.830
how could I lead troops into battle?

26:53.830 --> 26:54.490
Pull it out.

27:37.880 --> 27:39.530
Don't panic.

27:40.070 --> 27:42.200
It doesn't matter if I die
under treatment.

27:42.200 --> 27:43.180
I've already told my men

27:43.180 --> 27:43.830
what to do.

27:44.750 --> 27:46.080
No matter what happens,

27:46.110 --> 27:47.580
they will take you home.

27:53.240 --> 27:54.000
Don't move.

27:55.160 --> 27:56.550
If your wound remains closed

27:56.550 --> 27:58.540
by dawn, you'll be fine.

28:10.790 --> 28:12.000
It's the first time

28:13.270 --> 28:15.600
I've felt breathing could be so pleasant.

28:17.640 --> 28:20.200
Breathing is naturally pleasant.

28:21.230 --> 28:24.410
Eating, sunbathing, and drinking tea.

28:24.910 --> 28:26.570
They're all pleasant things.

28:27.680 --> 28:29.210
I really don't understand.

28:29.920 --> 28:31.180
Heaven created humans

28:31.960 --> 28:33.510
and grew crops on the earth.

28:33.750 --> 28:35.110
The crops produced fruits

28:35.110 --> 28:36.710
to satisfy people's hunger,

28:36.880 --> 28:37.960
and grew cotton

28:38.590 --> 28:39.720
to keep people warm.

28:39.920 --> 28:42.250
Why then do people
have to kill each other?

28:43.880 --> 28:46.740
You're a pampered young lady
from a wealthy family,

28:46.790 --> 28:48.640
how would you understand these things?

28:48.640 --> 28:50.300
I'm not a pampered young lady.

28:50.790 --> 28:52.880
A pampered young lady wouldn't know
how to treat wounds.

28:52.880 --> 28:54.140
My father is a scholar.

28:57.400 --> 28:58.200
At least,

28:59.160 --> 29:01.260
you can eat a full meal, right?

29:04.240 --> 29:06.110
Where I was born,

29:07.070 --> 29:08.530
girls were sold off

29:08.590 --> 29:10.030
before they even grew up.

29:12.790 --> 29:14.610
When boys reach 6 or 7 years old,

29:14.880 --> 29:18.410
they have to follow their fathers
into the mines to dig for coal.

29:19.920 --> 29:22.350
My father died when the mine collapsed,

29:22.440 --> 29:23.840
and he was buried inside.

29:24.880 --> 29:26.210
My two younger brothers

29:26.790 --> 29:28.630
died when water flooded the mine

29:28.680 --> 29:29.680
and drowned them.

29:30.400 --> 29:32.260
The youngest was only 4 years old.

29:33.680 --> 29:36.210
My mother had to borrow money
from loan sharks

29:36.480 --> 29:37.510
just to barely afford

29:37.510 --> 29:39.440
two dog-knocker coffins

29:40.310 --> 29:41.850
to bury them.

29:43.400 --> 29:45.130
What does "dog-knocker" mean?

29:48.270 --> 29:50.070
If the coffin boards were thick,

29:50.270 --> 29:51.330
that would be fine.

29:52.720 --> 29:55.450
But the poor people's coffin
are all made too thin

29:55.480 --> 29:57.010
and buried in shallow pits.

29:57.350 --> 29:59.310
Heavy rain washes them out easily.

30:00.200 --> 30:02.400
Wild dogs would then follow the scent

30:02.440 --> 30:05.100
and knock open the coffin lids
with their heads.

30:05.760 --> 30:07.430
They'd drag out the bodies,

30:07.790 --> 30:09.160
tear them apart wildly,

30:10.350 --> 30:12.550
and leave them in pieces.

30:14.640 --> 30:16.130
My two older brothers and I

30:16.680 --> 30:17.750
worked desperately

30:17.750 --> 30:19.120
to no end,

30:19.510 --> 30:21.970
but still couldn't pay
the loan sharks back.

30:22.000 --> 30:23.300
What's a loan shark?

30:27.640 --> 30:29.730
The mine owner knew we needed money.

30:30.270 --> 30:32.230
So, he convinced my two brothers

30:32.310 --> 30:34.570
to blow up the mountain with explosives.

30:35.070 --> 30:36.670
They couldn't escape in time

30:36.920 --> 30:38.780
and were killed in the explosion.

30:39.830 --> 30:41.270
My mother lost all hope.

30:42.680 --> 30:44.830
She made me one last full meal.

30:46.270 --> 30:47.670
Then, while I was asleep,

30:48.110 --> 30:49.970
she drowned herself in the river.

30:52.240 --> 30:54.570
After that, I joined the Resistance Army.

30:54.830 --> 30:56.200
My comrades told me

30:57.480 --> 30:59.750
that all the suffering of poor people
in this world

30:59.750 --> 31:00.400
is because of

31:00.400 --> 31:02.030
those bastards.

31:03.440 --> 31:04.760
So I swore

31:05.440 --> 31:07.700
to kill all the evil people in this world.

31:08.440 --> 31:09.270
But you killed

31:09.310 --> 31:10.640
those innocent people.

31:11.110 --> 31:12.710
They had done nothing to you.

31:12.880 --> 31:15.260
No one in this world is innocent.

31:16.270 --> 31:16.920
Fine.

31:17.200 --> 31:18.090
I won't mention it again.

31:18.090 --> 31:18.950
Don't be angry.

31:19.240 --> 31:21.370
It would be bad if your wound reopened.

31:25.830 --> 31:27.630
This has been upsetting for you.

31:29.570 --> 31:30.400
When you go back,

31:30.400 --> 31:31.830
I'll reward you generously.

31:31.830 --> 31:33.560
What's there to be upset about?

31:33.990 --> 31:36.440
You'll eventually return
to the battlefield

31:36.440 --> 31:38.070
and come back like this again.

31:38.070 --> 31:39.420
I'm a soldier.

31:39.830 --> 31:41.240
Fighting is my destiny.

31:43.680 --> 31:44.760
Besides,

31:44.830 --> 31:46.230
dying wouldn't be so bad.

31:47.590 --> 31:49.080
If I die, I can see

31:49.160 --> 31:50.890
my parents and brothers again.

31:53.830 --> 31:55.480
I miss them so much.

32:24.110 --> 32:24.540
Yimei.

32:27.220 --> 32:27.990
Gu.

32:28.470 --> 32:30.670
Your father asked me to give this to you.

32:33.540 --> 32:34.800
What did my father say?

32:34.830 --> 32:37.160
He wants you to return
as soon as possible.

32:40.080 --> 32:41.340
Are you doing alright?

32:45.270 --> 32:45.750
Here.

32:51.070 --> 32:52.270
You have knives and scissors here.

32:52.270 --> 32:52.920
If I really wanted to do something,

32:52.920 --> 32:54.920
I wouldn't need to sneak a weapon in.

32:55.350 --> 32:56.160
And you call yourself a deputy commander.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.070
You're such a coward.

32:57.070 --> 32:58.350
Who are you calling a coward?

32:58.350 --> 32:59.240
Say that again. I dare you.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.100
That's enough.

33:01.790 --> 33:02.960
You can't win an argument

33:02.960 --> 33:04.020
against a scholar.

33:04.590 --> 33:06.320
Let him come forward and speak.

33:06.960 --> 33:07.760
You heard him.

33:09.750 --> 33:11.640
General, about the hemp ropes
and tung oil...

33:11.640 --> 33:12.400
I know.

33:17.400 --> 33:19.350
I heard that you bought

33:19.550 --> 33:20.880
4,000 barrels of oil

33:21.350 --> 33:22.880
and six carts of hemp rope in Huizhou.

33:22.880 --> 33:23.510
Yes.

33:24.200 --> 33:25.350
I bought all the tung oil

33:25.350 --> 33:26.240
in Huizhou.

33:28.240 --> 33:29.310
A man of your word.

33:30.030 --> 33:31.090
You've earned back

33:31.240 --> 33:32.590
your life by yourself.

33:34.110 --> 33:35.710
I see you're feeling better.

33:35.880 --> 33:38.010
I'd like to take Yimei and leave first.

33:41.210 --> 33:42.550
When it's time to send her back,

33:42.550 --> 33:43.720
I will do so myself.

33:43.750 --> 33:44.810
No need to say more.

33:45.240 --> 33:46.350
You've kept your word.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.310
I'll keep mine.

33:49.200 --> 33:50.930
It's not that I don't trust you.

33:51.160 --> 33:53.610
I just think once the war breaks out,

33:54.270 --> 33:56.870
you might not
even be able to protect yourself.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.200
Take him away.

34:01.400 --> 34:01.930
Yes, sir.

34:02.310 --> 34:02.830
Out!

34:04.200 --> 34:05.270
-Get out!
-General!

34:05.270 --> 34:06.200
Get out!

34:07.830 --> 34:08.190
Go!

34:09.400 --> 34:10.639
Give me the medicine.

34:17.420 --> 34:18.190
General.

34:21.239 --> 34:22.389
Speak freely.

34:22.409 --> 34:23.320
She's such a blockhead,

34:23.320 --> 34:25.120
she won't understand anything.

34:26.670 --> 34:27.280
General.

34:27.900 --> 34:29.159
Actually, these days,

34:29.320 --> 34:30.710
the others in the camp

34:30.730 --> 34:31.400
keep asking

34:31.440 --> 34:32.810
when we're going to move.

34:32.810 --> 34:34.270
What's there to ask about?

34:35.000 --> 34:36.020
Our orders from above

34:36.020 --> 34:37.360
are to wait here for ships

34:37.360 --> 34:38.510
to transport the troops.

34:38.510 --> 34:39.239
I haven't even seen

34:39.239 --> 34:40.570
the shadow of a ship yet.

34:40.770 --> 34:41.840
But everyone's saying

34:41.840 --> 34:42.670
that our navy

34:42.690 --> 34:44.690
was defeated by the imperial court.

34:45.710 --> 34:46.480
Nonsense!

34:47.090 --> 34:47.860
General.

34:50.320 --> 34:51.670
Where did you hear that?

34:51.960 --> 34:52.800
From our men who escaped

34:52.800 --> 34:53.920
and came back.

34:54.280 --> 34:56.010
They say our navy has defected.

34:56.030 --> 34:57.850
It's not just a rumor. It's true.

34:58.000 --> 34:58.400
See?

34:58.480 --> 34:59.940
How fast the news travels!

35:00.350 --> 35:01.140
General.

35:01.320 --> 35:03.070
Are we stranded here alone?

35:03.630 --> 35:04.550
The men are saying

35:04.550 --> 35:06.280
we should have gone
to surround Hefei long ago.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.510
If we stay in this godforsaken place,

35:07.510 --> 35:09.370
we'll be swallowed whole one day.

35:11.070 --> 35:12.000
Bring me the map.

35:12.030 --> 35:12.630
Yes, sir.

35:18.920 --> 35:19.450
General.

35:21.500 --> 35:22.360
Here. Careful.

35:25.640 --> 35:27.060
[Angelica sinensis, Dipsacus asper 1 tael,
Cynanchum paniculatum
3 taels, Deer antler 0.5 tael]

35:27.510 --> 35:28.850
Who wrote on my map?

35:39.920 --> 35:41.660
Qimen and Anqing have fallen.

35:41.920 --> 35:43.710
The upper Yangtze is now exposed.

35:43.710 --> 35:44.800
If we go south now,

35:45.590 --> 35:46.550
we'll walk right into

35:46.550 --> 35:48.760
the imperial court's troops waiting there.

35:48.760 --> 35:49.600
If you have

35:49.630 --> 35:50.880
even the slightest thought of retreat,

35:50.880 --> 35:52.000
we'll be completely wiped out.

35:52.000 --> 35:53.200
What will you do then?

35:56.240 --> 35:57.670
Then, let's attack Hefei.

35:57.670 --> 35:58.440
Yes, General.

35:58.440 --> 35:59.570
General, let's attack Hefei.

35:59.570 --> 36:00.670
-Let's attack Hefei.
-Let's do it.

36:00.670 --> 36:01.440
Attack Hefei?

36:01.440 --> 36:03.100
We weren't ordered to do that.

36:04.230 --> 36:05.450
We were told to hold this position

36:05.450 --> 36:06.580
to relieve pressure

36:06.590 --> 36:07.790
for the siege forces.

36:08.440 --> 36:09.700
If we withdraw,

36:10.360 --> 36:12.000
the imperial court's forces will sweep in

36:12.000 --> 36:12.930
and immediately

36:13.200 --> 36:14.550
surround the Resistance Army

36:14.550 --> 36:15.720
besieging Hefei.

36:16.190 --> 36:17.990
Who will take responsibility for that?

36:17.990 --> 36:18.900
I will.

36:18.990 --> 36:19.550
You?

36:19.630 --> 36:21.090
How many heads do you have?

36:21.230 --> 36:21.920
General,

36:22.360 --> 36:23.800
the navy won't be coming.

36:24.320 --> 36:25.540
If we just wait here,

36:25.630 --> 36:27.030
when their cavalry arrives,

36:27.030 --> 36:27.670
one charge

36:27.670 --> 36:28.710
and they'll drive us all

36:28.710 --> 36:30.770
into the Yangtze to feed the turtles.

36:31.000 --> 36:31.880
We might as well

36:31.920 --> 36:33.360
go to Hefei and join the attack.

36:33.360 --> 36:35.420
We'll take the city, and all get rich.

36:43.030 --> 36:44.560
What if we can't take Hefei?

36:46.280 --> 36:47.630
If we can't take it,

36:48.840 --> 36:49.570
we'll either

36:50.190 --> 36:51.240
die

36:51.760 --> 36:52.400
or

36:53.550 --> 36:54.280
surrender.

36:56.030 --> 36:57.050
I’ll kill you!

36:57.110 --> 36:58.450
General, calm down!

36:58.480 --> 37:00.110
-General! Calm down!
-General.

37:00.110 --> 37:00.640
General!

37:00.640 --> 37:02.000
I don't want to live anymore.

37:02.000 --> 37:02.960
Ever since my two brothers

37:02.960 --> 37:03.790
died,

37:03.920 --> 37:05.450
I haven’t wanted to live anymore.

37:05.450 --> 37:06.150
Come on!

37:06.670 --> 37:07.590
Cut me down!

37:07.960 --> 37:08.590
Do it!

37:15.360 --> 37:17.960
I'm still investigating
the naval situation!

37:18.920 --> 37:20.920
If the navy has truly been defeated,

37:21.440 --> 37:22.840
we'll move immediately!

37:26.070 --> 37:27.000
But before that,

37:28.190 --> 37:30.200
if any of you stir up dissent again,

37:31.670 --> 37:33.330
I will personally behead you.

37:35.510 --> 37:36.230
I know.

37:37.710 --> 37:38.670
The battle has dragged on

37:38.670 --> 37:40.470
and everyone feels frustrated.

37:41.800 --> 37:43.740
But if we can't live well as humans,

37:44.360 --> 37:47.090
what makes you think we’d live
good lives as dogs?

37:47.360 --> 37:49.020
If you only wanted a full meal,

37:49.630 --> 37:51.510
why bother joining the Resistance Army?

37:51.510 --> 37:53.110
Why risk your life in battle?

37:54.190 --> 37:55.650
Those words you just said,

37:57.960 --> 37:59.890
do they honor our fallen brothers?

38:07.440 --> 38:08.700
Everyone, dismissed.

38:18.070 --> 38:18.760
Leave.

38:32.280 --> 38:33.320
Did I scare you?

38:35.190 --> 38:36.520
This is what war is like.

38:40.360 --> 38:41.620
The medicine is burnt.

38:47.840 --> 38:48.550
Here.

38:56.920 --> 39:01.400
Tea picking in January marks the new year.

39:01.670 --> 39:06.070
Tea picking in February
welcomes the new spring.

39:06.550 --> 39:11.030
Tea picking in March,
when peach blossoms are red.

39:11.510 --> 39:15.760
Tea picking in April makes us busy.

39:16.360 --> 39:20.760
Tea picking in September,
when chrysanthemums are yellow.

39:21.190 --> 39:25.590
Tea picking in October,
when it's briefly warm.

39:26.150 --> 39:30.510
Tea picking in November,
when snowflakes fall.

39:30.880 --> 39:39.070
Tea picking in December,
when another year passes.

40:36.920 --> 40:37.920
Drink some water.

40:54.020 --> 40:55.880
Sir, please don't worry anymore.

40:56.430 --> 40:58.890
I'll go to the military camp again
tomorrow.

40:59.190 --> 41:01.760
Yimei is a good person,
heaven will protect her.

41:01.760 --> 41:03.220
She's always been so kind,

41:03.360 --> 41:03.880
she wouldn't even

41:03.880 --> 41:04.760
step on an ant.

41:05.650 --> 41:07.850
Heaven won't let someone like her down.

41:07.920 --> 41:09.320
You can't go there again.

41:11.070 --> 41:13.400
Tigers and wolves don't listen to reason.

41:14.070 --> 41:15.030
They didn't eat you today

41:15.030 --> 41:16.560
because you were lucky,

41:16.670 --> 41:19.070
not because they've changed their nature.

41:21.440 --> 41:23.170
I've already lost my daughter.

41:26.070 --> 41:27.600
If I were to lose you as well,

41:29.870 --> 41:31.820
I don’t think I could keep living.

41:32.030 --> 41:32.840
Sir,

41:33.070 --> 41:34.330
don't think like that.

41:34.930 --> 41:36.020
In this world,

41:36.320 --> 41:38.120
nothing is greater than reason.

41:38.690 --> 41:39.480
She has already saved

41:39.480 --> 41:40.680
that general's life.

41:41.110 --> 41:42.570
What more could they want?

41:43.420 --> 41:45.860
Reason is something between humans.

41:46.550 --> 41:48.950
What reason can you talk about
with beasts?

41:49.710 --> 41:50.880
Look at tigers and wolves,

41:50.880 --> 41:52.540
they don't eat their own kind.

41:52.920 --> 41:53.580
But humans?

41:54.110 --> 41:55.630
They specifically slaughter and enslave

41:55.630 --> 41:56.540
their own kind.

41:56.590 --> 41:58.150
They're worse than beasts.

41:58.760 --> 42:00.360
Who can you reason with then?

42:08.110 --> 42:09.960
I've been thinking these days.

42:12.070 --> 42:14.000
Now that Yimei has been taken away,

42:14.110 --> 42:15.840
only a few outcomes may happen.

42:16.830 --> 42:17.520
Outcome 1,

42:18.960 --> 42:20.890
she returns unharmed.

42:22.000 --> 42:23.710
This is certainly the best outcome.

42:23.710 --> 42:25.840
May all the Bodhisattvas protect her.

42:28.030 --> 42:28.670
Outcome 3

42:30.710 --> 42:32.440
is the worst outcome.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.400
Only her body comes back.

42:43.590 --> 42:45.760
Maybe, we might not even find her body.

42:54.840 --> 42:56.950
If so, I would soon follow her.

42:59.150 --> 43:01.030
But I fear outcome 2.
